00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:46.460
interpretation first, then locate sampling points specifically to test the dominant transport pathways,

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:52.740
and finally document the heterogeneity explicitly in the regulatory submission so that decision-makers

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:58.080
